  "notes": "Franklin Lakes has a complex settlement history: FSHC settlement 2018, JOR 2019, SHG (Parsons Pond/Cigna) settlement 2023, FSHC 2023 amendment, Amended JOR November 27, 2024. For 4th Round: NJBA and FSHC both challenged; mediation April 24, 2025; court order May 19, 2025 established present need = 65 and 4th Round prospective need = 480. PB adopted HEFSP June 19, 2025; GB endorsed June 19, 2025 (filing date June 20, 2025 per document header). RDP = 445 (carried from prior rounds: the Third Round VLA was completed less than 2 years prior to the 4th Round analysis, so no new RDP analysis was required; the 445 figure reflects credits toward prior round obligations now applied to 4th Round). Plan shows 8 components satisfying 333 base + 112 bonus = 445 total RDP credits. Unmet need = 480 - 445 = 35 units. 7 overlay zones address unmet need. Candidate snapshot had 4 sites (Becton Dickinson Hekemian campus, Cigna/Parsons Pond, Municipal 100% Affordable, 370-378 Pulis Ave) — document identifies Parsons Pond (Block 2607 L:1) and 7 unmet need overlays; the Becton Dickinson/Hekemian campus is AH Overlay 4 (Block 1404 area). The 370-378 Pulis Ave (Trelia) site is not mentioned in the adopted HEFSP. Note: document was filed June 6, 2025 per transaction ID; PB adopted June 19/20, 2025.",
